{"id":"21aa705043d57f18","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-sde.md","title":"Stochastic Differential Equation","display":"df-sde — Stochastic Differential Equation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-sde","aliases":["58-df-sde","Stochastic Differential Equation"],"display":"df-sde — Stochastic Differential Equation","depends_on":["[[58-df-brownian-motion]]","[[../batch04/58-df-adapted.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md]]","[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-prob2-filtration.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-sde"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-sde</span><span>Stochastic Differential Equation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-sde — Stochastic Differential Equation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"948f8f3178040b74\" href=\"?note=948f8f3178040b74\" title=\"58-df-brownian-motion\">58-df-brownian-motion</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6493b2eeaa7f968f\" href=\"?note=6493b2eeaa7f968f\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-adapted.md\">../batch04/58-df-adapted.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0578a357a86e9d8f\" href=\"?note=0578a357a86e9d8f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md\">../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"20d69bde348c5967\" href=\"?note=20d69bde348c5967\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-zfc-prob2-filtration.md\">../batch10/58-df-zfc-prob2-filtration.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb F,\\mathbb P,X,B,b,\\sigma,X_0,L,J\\in V\">\\(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb F,\\mathbb P,X,B,b,\\sigma,X_0,L,J\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcProb2Filtration}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcProb2Filtration}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BrownianMotion}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{BrownianMotion}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Adapted}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{Adapted}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SDESolution}_S\\subseteq V^{11}\">\\(\\mathrm{SDESolution}_S\\subseteq V^{11}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sde}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{SDESolution}_S(X,b,\\sigma,B,X_0,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb F,\\mathbb P,L,J)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcProb2Filtration}_S(\\mathbb F,\\langle\\mathbb R_{\\geq0},\\leq\\rangle)\n\\land\\mathrm{BrownianMotion}_S(B,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb F,\\mathbb P)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Adapted}_S(X,\\mathbb F,\\mathbb R_{\\geq0},\\Omega)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(X,\\mathbb R_{\\geq0},\\mathbb R^\\Omega)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(X_0,\\Omega,\\mathbb R)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Function}(b,\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\times\\mathbb R,\\mathbb R)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\sigma,\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\times\\mathbb R,\\mathbb R)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Function}(L,\\{b\\}\\times\\{X\\}\\times\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\times\\Omega,\\mathbb R)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(J,\\{\\sigma\\}\\times\\{X\\}\\times\\{B\\}\\times\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\times\\Omega,\\mathbb R)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathbb P(\\{\\omega\\in\\Omega:X(0)(\\omega)=X_0(\\omega)\\})=1\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\n\\mathbb P\\!\\left(\\left\\{\\omega\\in\\Omega:\nX(t)(\\omega)=X_0(\\omega)+L(\\langle b,X,t,\\omega\\rangle)\n+J(\\langle\\sigma,X,B,t,\\omega\\rangle)\\right\\}\\right)=1.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sde}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{SDESolution}_S(X,b,\\sigma,B,X_0,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb F,\\mathbb P,L,J)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcProb2Filtration}_S(\\mathbb F,\\langle\\mathbb R_{\\geq0},\\leq\\rangle)\n\\land\\mathrm{BrownianMotion}_S(B,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb F,\\mathbb P)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Adapted}_S(X,\\mathbb F,\\mathbb R_{\\geq0},\\Omega)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(X,\\mathbb R_{\\geq0},\\mathbb R^\\Omega)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(X_0,\\Omega,\\mathbb R)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Function}(b,\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\times\\mathbb R,\\mathbb R)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\sigma,\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\times\\mathbb R,\\mathbb R)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Function}(L,\\{b\\}\\times\\{X\\}\\times\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\times\\Omega,\\mathbb R)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(J,\\{\\sigma\\}\\times\\{X\\}\\times\\{B\\}\\times\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\times\\Omega,\\mathbb R)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathbb P(\\{\\omega\\in\\Omega:X(0)(\\omega)=X_0(\\omega)\\})=1\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\n\\mathbb P\\!\\left(\\left\\{\\omega\\in\\Omega:\nX(t)(\\omega)=X_0(\\omega)+L(\\langle b,X,t,\\omega\\rangle)\n+J(\\langle\\sigma,X,B,t,\\omega\\rangle)\\right\\}\\right)=1.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L(\\langle b,X,t,\\omega\\rangle)\">\\(L(\\langle b,X,t,\\omega\\rangle)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J(\\langle\\sigma,X,B,t,\\omega\\rangle)\">\\(J(\\langle\\sigma,X,B,t,\\omega\\rangle)\\)</span> are explicit parameters for the drift and Itô integral values; this prevents either integration convention from being hidden.</li>\n<li>SDE: differential equation with Brownian motion term</li>\n<li>Itô integral: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\int_0^t \\sigma\\,dB\">\\(\\int_0^t \\sigma\\,dB\\)</span> is martingale</li>\n<li>Itô's formula: change of variables for Itô processes</li>\n<li>Existence and uniqueness: Lipschitz conditions</li>\n<li>Strong/weak solutions: pathwise vs distribution sense</li>\n<li>Feynman-Kac: connection to PDE via expectation</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Oksendal, Stochastic Differential Equations</li>\n<li>Karatzas and Shreve, Brownian Motion and Stochastic Calculus</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-brownian-motion","status":"resolved","id":"948f8f3178040b74","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-brownian-motion]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-adapted.md","status":"resolved","id":"6493b2eeaa7f968f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-adapted.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"0578a357a86e9d8f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-zfc-prob2-filtration.md","status":"resolved","id":"20d69bde348c5967","anchor":"ref-4","targetAn